{"3892600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arena Breakers", "steam_appid": 3892600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>GameDays 2025</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/a912ff5e9b74514424b000114f34a05f.avif?t=1776086115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena with mini tank drones (UGVs) and unleash chaos on a fully destructible battlefield! Choose from a variety of tank drone types, camouflages and assault turrets - from rapid-fire rotary miniguns to heavy machine guns and rocket launchers. Each weapon affects your strategy and fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/6f5161db29c46a3cc74fd5d618e3f387.poster.avif?t=1776086115\" width=474 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/6f5161db29c46a3cc74fd5d618e3f387.webm?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/6f5161db29c46a3cc74fd5d618e3f387.mp4?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>Fully destructible battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cover lasts forever. Destroy walls, punch through buildings, surprise the enemy hidden upstairs. Every shot changes the environment in real time - adapt or fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/d8ae58862f58b1bcc8b5d64b0ef84bbd.poster.avif?t=1776086115\" width=474 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/d8ae58862f58b1bcc8b5d64b0ef84bbd.webm?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/d8ae58862f58b1bcc8b5d64b0ef84bbd.mp4?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ Online multiplayer battles for up to 10 players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw yourself into the action in a variety of game modes such as Deathmatch, Domination, or Base Defense. Show your tactical skills and dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/900d4d8ae2b0ec93512e37fc1b984be4.poster.avif?t=1776086115\" width=474 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/900d4d8ae2b0ec93512e37fc1b984be4.webm?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/900d4d8ae2b0ec93512e37fc1b984be4.mp4?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛠️ Map editor and custom arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create, edit and share your own battlefields. Deploy buildings, barricades, explosive barrels or dense bushes for sneaky hiding places. Set the weather, rules and create your own playground style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎯 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different tank designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camo skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of assault turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environments in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map editor with adjustable weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom match rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 10 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive arcade fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/8e61d08eb0a4be7b0d54fc0ca3dc6fc7.poster.avif?t=1776086115\" width=474 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/8e61d08eb0a4be7b0d54fc0ca3dc6fc7.webm?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/8e61d08eb0a4be7b0d54fc0ca3dc6fc7.mp4?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Sound interesting?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like the project, Wishlist is the best way to support a solo indie developer project and not miss its release. Are you ready to throw yourself into the fray?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/cdf680b372a1788ac5f1e8d2b51f89b8.poster.avif?t=1776086115\" width=674 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/cdf680b372a1788ac5f1e8d2b51f89b8.webm?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892600/extras/cdf680b372a1788ac5f1e8d2b51f89b8.mp4?t=1776086115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena with mini tank drones (UGVs)